@Crephore.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180

### Sign up
POST {{Crephore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Chris",
  "lastName": "Oswa",
  "email": "chris@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Log in
# @name login
POST {{Crephore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "chris@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Log out
POST {{Crephore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Current user
GET {{Crephore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
